" wanderlan  1 Overview  2 Sites  3 VLANs  4 MACs  5 Log  6 Setup  7 Settings    "
"┌ Settings (Enter: change, Up/Down: more) ─────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│  Path MTU check       every 5m                                               ║"
"│  TCP MSS              from the path MTU                                      ║"
"│  Control port         51821                                                  █"
"│This host                                                                     █"
"│  This site            heim                                                   █"
"│ ┌ Trunk ports of the tunnel to haus2 ──────────────────────────────────────┐ █"
"│R│    #  INTERFACE       KIND      STATE MTU   NOTE                         │ █"
"│ │[ ]    br-lan          bridge    up    1500  a bridge                     │ █"
"│ │[ ]    ens18           physical  up    1500  tunnels to buero             │ █"
"│ │[ ]    ens19           physical  up    1500  in the default trunk         │ █"
"│ │[ ]    eth1            physical  down  1500  in br-lan                    │ █"
"│T│ other:                   an interface that is not there yet              │ █"
"│ │                                                                          │ ║"
"│ │ Nothing chosen: the tunnel to haus2 uses the default trunk (ens19).      │ ║"
"└─└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘─┘"
" Local interfaces bridged with the tunnel to haus2 (Enter lists those of this   "
" host); none: the default trunk. Others make it a segment of its own (bridge    "
" wl-<first>): only their network reaches haus2.                                 "
" Changes go into the draft; a reviews and applies them, c confirms.             "
"                                                                                "
"                                  1 blocked (see 1)  draft: no changes  heim r7 "
" Space  choose   m  main port   Enter  save to draft   Esc  cancel              "
